# <type>(<scope>): <concise imperative summary in 50-72 chars>
#
# --- CIRCUMSTANCE GUIDELINES ---
# * feat:     [Motivation, Architecture, UX/API Impact, Verification]
# * fix:      [Issue/Incident, Root Cause, Blast Radius, Resolution, Regression Guard]
# * perf:     [Bottleneck, Optimization, Before vs. After Metrics (latency/RAM)]
# * sec:      [Threat Model, Defense Layer, Zero-Secret / Privacy Verification]
# * refactor: [Architectural Goal, Invariant Guarantee (Zero Behavioral Drift)]
# * sync:     [Upstream Harper SHA, New Rules/Parsers Checked, Build/Test Status]
# * ml:       [Dataset/Config, Crucible Gate, Held-Out Metric Delta]
# * BREAKING: Append ! to header & write BREAKING CHANGE: <migration path>
#
# --- SCOPES ---
# core | db | ai | daemon | ls | wasm | cli | ui | browser | vscode | obsidian | desktop | web | ml | rules | sync | deps | repo
#
# --- VERIFICATION & EVIDENCE ---
# - Rust: cargo check / cargo clippy / cargo test (X/X passing)
# - TS/JS: pnpm -r typecheck / test / build (X/X passing)
# - Python/ML: uv run pytest (X/X passing)
#
# Refs: #XX | Upstream: harper@<sha>
